cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "prais: Prais-Winsten Estimator for AR(1) Serial Correlation"
abstract: "The Prais-Winsten estimator (Prais & Winsten, 1954) takes into account AR(1) serial correlation of the errors in a linear regression model. The procedure recursively estimates the coefficients and the error autocorrelation of the specified model until sufficient convergence of the AR(1) coefficient is attained."
